                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "658358a8-9869-30e1-ac30-ba1e1761520b",
                        "entry_id": "f70ac5e1-67b0-3711-81ae-d42d21b524f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A species of firefly, Photinus pyralis"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a1e99b4-e8ef-40d6-a175-7eb2ac211bd4",
                                "sense_id": "658358a8-9869-30e1-ac30-ba1e1761520b",
                                "text": "As Loeb has shown by many experiments, the phototropic phenomena of animals differ not at all from those of plants, and they carry no more psychism in a polyp or in a pyralis than in a geranium or in a volvox."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63918b76-d0fe-4fe6-98c8-d582d733a25a",
                                "sense_id": "658358a8-9869-30e1-ac30-ba1e1761520b",
                                "text": "If you have an opportunity to experiment with Photinus pyralis, try the following: Start a male toward you by answering him properly, that is, as a pyralis female would answer him, once or twice."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfa493fe-9cf0-4219-8472-a422383e5766",
                                "sense_id": "658358a8-9869-30e1-ac30-ba1e1761520b",
                                "text": "When a pyralis female sees a flash of the appropriate characteristics, she waits 2 seconds and then emits her own half-second flash."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e720cc60-f881-3eeb-baba-823362f538e5",
                        "entry_id": "f70ac5e1-67b0-3711-81ae-d42d21b524f9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A moth of the genus Pyralis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "530fe134-a04b-4127-9842-8e261c85453b",
                                "sense_id": "e720cc60-f881-3eeb-baba-823362f538e5",
                                "text": "At first there was a belief that the caterpillar was that of a pyralis like that which caused such great loss to beet growers in southern Russia, Roumania and North America."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "639a82d3-a349-45bb-b790-83cdd2ecf84c",
                                "sense_id": "e720cc60-f881-3eeb-baba-823362f538e5",
                                "text": "This once happened in a hemp field destroyed by a pyralis, described by me in a special memoir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "689c0a8b-b67a-4e3c-9285-6a413b36a69a",
                                "sense_id": "e720cc60-f881-3eeb-baba-823362f538e5",
                                "text": "What would have been the opinion of the public, seeing e.g. a butterfly and a pyralis placed in the same genus ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
